 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "\"Monban Yattero\" to Iware Juugo Nen, Tsuttatetteru Aida ni Ore no Maryoku ga 9999 \"Saikyou\" ni Sodattemashita"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "「門番やってろ」と言われ15年、突っ立ってる間に俺の魔力が9999（最強）に育ってました"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "\"Monban Yattero\" to Iware 15 Nen, Tsuttatetteru Aida ni Ore no Maryoku ga 9999 \"Saikyou\" ni Sodattemashita"
   },
   {
    "en": "Being Told \"Do Your Best\" for 15 Years, My Magical Power has Grown to 9999 \"The Strongest\""
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Although Royle is blessed with a good physique, he was told that he had no talent for fighting, and was forced to work as a lonely gatekeeper for 15 years. While he is working, all he can do is fantasize about the adventure stories in which he is the main character, and his job as gatekeeper is replaced by an \"automatic surveillance interception magic tool\" and he is laid off. Loyle is at a loss, but on the way to another town, he meets the saint Diz. After meeting her, he discovers that the \"strongest original magic\" that he always used in his delusions can in fact be used in reality...",
   "ja": "恵まれた体格だが「戦う才能がない」と言われ、15年間も孤独に門番の仕事をやらされていたロイル。勤務中は自分が主⼈公の冒険物語を空想するくらしかやることがなく、その門番の仕事も”自動監視迎撃魔道具”に取って代わられリストラされてしまう。 途方に暮れるロイルだったが、その道中での聖女ディズと出会う。彼女と出会ったのをきっかけに、なぜか妄想の中で使えていた「最強のオリジナル魔術」が現実で使えることを発見してしまい…… 。"
  },
